---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { paths } from '../lib/paths';
---

<BaseLayout title="Join" description="Join Epsilon Prime Research.">
  <h1 class="page-title">Join the lab</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">
    We welcome IIT Bombay students interested in AI efficiency — making models cheaper, faster, and
    leaner without giving up quality. See our <a href={paths.projects}>projects</a> and
    <a href={paths.people}>people</a> for context.
  </p>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>External students</h2>
    <p>
      The lab is not currently set up to support external students. We cannot provide computational
      resources outside IIT Bombay, and informal engagements often lack a clear commitment while still
      consuming substantial PI and on-campus student time.
    </p>
    <p>
      We plan to open a more formal path for external students to join in the future. Until then,
      please do <strong>not</strong> email about summer or winter internships — we cannot respond to
      those requests.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>What we look for</h2>
    <p>
      Interest in efficient ML systems, strong coding and math foundations, and curiosity about measuring
      real compute–quality tradeoffs.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>How to apply (IIT Bombay)</h2>
    <p>
      If you are at IIT Bombay, email
      <a href="mailto:apdesai@cse.iitb.ac.in">apdesai[at]cse.iitb.ac.in</a> with a CV, a short note on
      your interests, and any relevant links (GitHub, papers, projects).
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
